{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42330","headline":"严相公宅牡丹 · 徐铉","name":"严相公宅牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"但是豪家重牡丹，争如丞相阁前看。\n凤楼日暖开偏早，鸡树阴浓谢更难。\n数朵已应迷国艳，一枝何幸上尘冠。\n不知更许凭栏否，烂熳春光未肯残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}